OL,3,GNEWSATribute to 'much-loved'
OL,4,Amotorcyclist killed in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorcyclist who was killed in a
OL,7,Fcrash involving a car was "funny,
OL,8,Fcheeky, caring, adventurous and so full
OL,9,Fof life", his family has said.
OL,11,FCarl McCaskill, 43, died at the scene
OL,12,Fof the crash involving an Audi in Cane
OL,13,FEnd on the A4074 in south Oxfordshire
OL,14,Fon 11 October.
OL,16,FAn inquest opening held at Oxford
OL,17,FCoroner's Court on Thursday heard he
OL,18,Fwas a site manager who lived in
OL,19,FReading.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
